    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present No. 21 Castleview Park to the open market.\n\nThis well-presented two-bedroom mid-terrace home is ideally situated on a quiet resi-dential street in a mature and sought after development, convenient to Swords and a host of local amenities. \n\nAccommodation briefly comprises welcoming entrance hall, a fitted kitchen/dining area, a spacious lounge with understairs storage, and bright con-servatory on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms and family bathroom. \n\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a private garden, mainly laid in lawn.\n\nCastleview is an excellent family home, convenient to Dublin Airport, the M50 and M1 motorways. There is an abundance of public transport options servicing the area, with the Swords express bus providing direct access to Dublin city centre. This property rep-resents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers or investors alike and must be viewed to be fully appreciated."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nWood floor, coat rack, alarm panel, and stairs to first floor landing\n\nLounge: - \nWood floor, feature fireplace with gas fire, large understairs storage. Double doors to conservatory.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room: - \nRange of matching wall and floor units, tiled splashback, built in oven, gas hob and extractor fan plumbed for washing machine, tiled floor. Double glazed bay window to front.\n\nConservatory: - \nWood flooring, double glazed door to rear garden.\n\nUPSTAIRS - \n\n\nLanding: - \nHot press and access to attic.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nRange of built in wardrobes, radiator and double glazed window to front\n\nBedroom 2: - \nRange of built in wardrobes, radiator and double glazed window to front.\n\nBathroom: - \nComprising bath, Wc, wash hand basin, partly tiled walls, tiled floor.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Mid Terrace Family Residence</li><li>Mature and sought after development</li><li>Spacious lounge</li><li>Kitchen/Dining</li><li>Conservatory</li><li>Two double bedrooms</li><li>Family bathroom</li><li>Cul de sac location</li><li>Private rear garden</li><li>No onward chain</ul>"
      },
